OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F406A1785844078
OL,3,CCargo ship workers attacked in
OL,4,Csuspected hate crime near Bristol
OL,6,FThree people have been arrested after
OL,7,Fthree Filipino cargo ship workers were
OL,8,Finjured in a suspected hate crime near
OL,9,FBristol.
OL,11,FOfficers were called to Richmond
OL,12,FTerrace in Avonmouth at around 8.30pm
OL,13,Fon Friday 31 July, following reports
OL,14,Fof an altercation involving a number
OL,15,Fof people.
OL,17,FAvon and Somerset Police have
OL,18,Fconfirmed a man sustained serious
OL,19,Finjuries and remains in hospital in a
OL,20,Fcritical condition. His next of kin
OL,21,Fhave been notified.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/6
