FL,407,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40602
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F406A1785844078
OL,3,CCargo ship workers attacked in
OL,4,Csuspected hate crime near Bristol
OL,6,FA second man also needed treatment but
OL,7,Fhas since been discharged from
OL,8,Fhospital, while a third man sustained
OL,9,Fminor injuries.
OL,11,FAll three of the victims are staff
OL,12,Fmembers from a cargo ship that
OL,13,Frecently docked at Avonmouth and all
OL,14,Fare Filipino nationals.
OL,16,FThree people have since been arrested
OL,17,Fon suspicion of attempted murder and
OL,18,Fofficers have confirmed the incident
OL,19,Fis being treated as a suspected hate
OL,20,Fcrime, after reports of racist
OL,21,Flanguage being used during the attack.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/6
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
