FL,407,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40603
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F406A1785844078
OL,3,CCargo ship workers attacked in
OL,4,Csuspected hate crime near Bristol
OL,6,FTwo men, aged 19 and 45, as well as a
OL,7,F17-year-old man, are being questioned
OL,8,Fon suspicion of attempted murder in
OL,9,Fpolice custody.
OL,11,FWhile a 38-year-old woman is also in
OL,12,Fcustody having been arrested on
OL,13,Fsuspicion of assisting an offender.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/6
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
