FL,407,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40604
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F406A1785844078
OL,3,CCargo ship workers attacked in
OL,4,Csuspected hate crime near Bristol
OL,6,FIn a statement, superintendent Deepak
OL,7,FKenth, said: "We understand that the
OL,8,Fthree men who sustained injuries,
OL,9,Fincluding the man who remains in
OL,10,Fhospital, are staff members on a cargo
OL,11,Fship that recently docked at
OL,12,FAvonmouth. All three victims are
OL,13,FFilipino nationals.
OL,15,F"There has been a suggestion that
OL,16,Fracist language was directed towards
OL,17,Fat least one of the victims during the
OL,18,Fattack. Therefore, we are treating
OL,19,Fthis as a suspected hate crime at this
OL,20,Fpoint, pending further information
OL,21,Fcoming to light during our enquiries.
OL,26,@oD@NOUwD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/6
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,407,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40605
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F406A1785844078
OL,3,CCargo ship workers attacked in
OL,4,Csuspected hate crime near Bristol
OL,6,F"We are aware there is some
OL,7,Fspeculation online suggesting the
OL,8,Finjuries were caused by a knife, or a
OL,9,Fsimilar weapon, but that is not the
OL,10,Fcase.
OL,12,F"While the full circumstances around
OL,13,Fwhat happened remain unconfirmed and
OL,14,Funder investigation, based on our
OL,15,Fcurrent understanding we believe this
OL,16,Fto be an isolated incident and there
OL,17,Fto be no wider risk to public safety.
OL,26,@nD@AOUtD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/6
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
