OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,407,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40606
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F406A1785844078
OL,3,CCargo ship workers attacked in
OL,4,Csuspected hate crime near Bristol
OL,6,F"We are grateful to everyone who has
OL,7,Fprovided information to aid our
OL,8,Fenquiries to date, and appeal for
OL,9,Fanyone else who has not yet come
OL,10,Fforward to please contact us."
OL,12,FAvon and Somerset Police have made
OL,13,FStand Against Racism and Inequality
OL,14,F(SARI) aware, and the organisation is
OL,15,Fhelping to support the victims.
OL,26,@nD@AOUrD@^O]
